{"id":"vod_bf_4387","vodId":"4387","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"超能力女儿","name_cn":"超能力女儿","date":"2018-01-01","year":"2018","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20230424-5/fdb9492253f242999a974bd3a5bd7922.jpg"},"summary":"新田义史（中岛良树 配音）是就职于芦川组的黑社会干部，虽然长相非常的凶恶，从事的也是令人闻风丧胆的职业，但实际上，新田义史拥有一颗十分善良的心灵。一天，一个神秘的椭圆形物体掉落到了新田义史的房间里，在那里出现了一个美丽的少女雏（田中贵子 配音）。面无表情的雏向新田义史强大的念动力，迫于雏的淫威，新田义史不得不让她以女儿的身份住进自己的家中，就这样，黑社会人事和超能力少女的同居生活开始了。　　因为拥有非常强大的力量，雏常常会失控暴走，制造了一堆麻烦留给新田义史来扫尾。起初，“父女”两人之间的关系十分紧张，但随着时间的推移，竟然真的生出的亲情。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-06-09 23:13:46","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/chaonenglinver/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/chaonenglinver/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/chaonenglinver/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/chaonenglinver/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/chaonenglinver/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/chaonenglinver/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/chaonenglinver/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/chaonenglinver/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/chaonenglinver/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/chaonenglinver/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/chaonenglinver/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/chaonenglinver/第12集/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:31:45.926Z"}